C Notes on Teetering and Thermobaric Weapons:
notes:
1. the way that a thermobaric bomb works is that it spreads out its fuel as a gas into the atmosphere before detonation. so that it doesn't need an oxidizer and can just be all fuel, thereby achieving a more energetic explosion for the same weight.
that's why I said "yes, thermobaric, even though it's inside a guy" when I described it. I've been imagining a somewhat horrible scene of the fuel pouring out of Harris's orifices and pores, and then exploding.

2. I wasn't intending for the activation phrase to be what triggers the detonation. It wakes him up as a sleeper agent. He can then consciously activate the detonation when the time is right.
but that could all be changed. It would be quite funny is he woke as a sleeper agent and then started leaking gas and then exploded.
]

